s": null, "seed": 65886, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 19.0, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "周复盘（1 小时）\n胜率 / 盈亏比 / 期望 / 执行率\n对比上周：执行率↓？计划外？\n权益曲线是否接近警戒线\n这周盈亏是系统还是运气？", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0006", "originalText": "周复盘（1 小时）\n胜率 / 盈亏比 / 期望 / 执行率\n对比上周：执行率↓？计划外？\n权益曲线是否接近警戒线\n这周盈亏是系统还是运气？", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 17.1}, {"id": "e0008", "type": "arrow", "x": 636.0, "y": 274.32000000000005, "width": 44.799999999999955, "height": 1.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#90a4ae", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.0, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 52913, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "points": [[636.0, 274.32000000000005], [680.8, 274.32000000000005]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": "arrow"}, {"id": "e0009", "type": "rectangle", "x": 680.8, "y": 195.60000000000002, "width": 249.6, "height": 156.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#90a4ae", "backgroundColor": "#e6eaed", "fillStyle": "hachure", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 24726, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "e0010", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0010", "type": "text", "x": 688.8, "y": 203.60000000000002, "width": 233.6, "height": 140.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 53912, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 19.0, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "月复盘（半天）\n100+ 笔重算期望值\n砍掉持续亏损的 setup\n审视心理模式（7.5 高危画像）\n决定：继续 / 优化 / 暂停", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0009", "originalText": "月复盘（半天）\n100+ 笔重算期望值\n砍掉持续亏损的 setup\n审视心理模式（7.5 高危画像）\n决定：继续 / 优化 / 暂停", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 17.1}, {"id": "e0011", "type": "rectangle", "x": 92.0, "y": 410.0, "width": 832.0, "height": 67.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#00897b", "backgroundColor": "#c6e5e1", "fillStyle": "hachure", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 69204, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "e0012", "type": "text"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e0012", "type": "text", "x": 100.0, "y": 418.0, "width": 816.0, "height": 51.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 81088, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "fontSize": 19.95, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "决策反馈：继续 / 优化 / 暂停——把结论带回下一个日复盘（修正规则或坚持规则）", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "containerId": "e0011", "originalText": "决策反馈：继续 / 优化 / 暂停——把结论带回下一个日复盘（修正规则或坚持规则）", "lineHeight": 1.3, "baseline": 17.955}, {"id": "e0013", "type": "arrow", "x": 805.6, "y": 352.40000000000003, "width": 1.0, "height": 57.599999999999966, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#263238", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2.0, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 2}, "seed": 8490, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1, "isD